-- Expand 𝐏 beyond hard news while keeping provenance and image requirements.
UPDATE topics
SET description = '全球热点、X 热帖与美图热图',
    brief = '中文：收集最近 24 小时最值得关注的视觉内容，覆盖三类：全球热点新闻现场；x.com 上有明确热度或传播证据、且配有图片的公开热帖；以及正在被广泛分享的公开美图/热图（自然风光、城市、动物、文化、人物写真、美女、时尚街拍和公共场景等）。每条必须有可以核实的图片，优先使用官方、现场、原作者或权威媒体发布的图片。允许使用合适的 AI 生成图，但必须明确标注 AI generated，不能把生成图写成现场照片。美图/热图必须说明拍摄地点、时间或传播背景，不要把普通图库图包装成热点。人物和美女图片必须来自公开来源，排除私密、露骨、偷拍或未成年人性化内容。每条图片必须与该条文章或 X 帖子直接对应，并用一句话准确说明画面。排除 Image not available、商标占位图、默认缩略图、广告、拼图、血腥画面、未经证实的传闻和重复内容。没有可靠图片的内容不要返回。\nEnglish: Collect the most notable visual content from the past 24 hours in three lanes: global breaking-news scenes; public x.com posts with clear engagement or circulation evidence and an image; and widely shared public photo trends such as nature, cities, animals, culture, portraits, beauty and fashion street photography, and public scenes. Every item needs a verifiable image from an official, eyewitness, original-author or authoritative-media source. Suitable AI-generated images are allowed but must be clearly labeled AI generated and never presented as on-site photography. Photo trends must include a verified place, time or circulation context and must not turn an ordinary stock image into a trend. Portrait and beauty images must come from public sources; exclude private, explicit, voyeuristic or sexualized-minor content. The image must directly correspond to the item article or X post, with a factual one-sentence caption. Exclude Image not available placeholders, logos, default thumbnails, ads, collages, graphic violence, unverified rumors and duplicates. Omit items without a reliable image.',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'p' AND owner_user_id IS NULL;
